                "loc": "1KI.6.1+1KI.6.2+1KI.6.3+1KI.6.4+1KI.6.5+1KI.6.6+1KI.6.7+1KI.6.8+1KI.6.9+1KI.6.10+1KI.6.11+1KI.6.12+1KI.6.13+1KI.6.14+1KI.6.15+1KI.6.16+1KI.6.17+1KI.6.18+1KI.6.19+1KI.6.20+1KI.6.21+1KI.6.22+1KI.6.23+1KI.6.24+1KI.6.25+1KI.6.26+1KI.6.27+1KI.6.28+1KI.6.29+1KI.6.30+1KI.6.31+1KI.6.32+1KI.6.33+1KI.6.34+1KI.6.35+1KI.6.36+1KI.6.37+1KI.6.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bab. 6.1-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.3.1+2CH.3.2+2CH.3.3+2CH.3.4+2CH.3.5+2CH.3.6+2CH.3.7+2CH.3.8+2CH.3.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ke Ch. 3.1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ne lola, lisiisi liabao liabotookhelesia enje we Lukaangu. Ne buleeyi bwe sisele sie khupiimila sisiaba mukhono mwo mundu oyo siaba chimita chitaru, mala aapiimila lisiisi. Bukhiikha liaba chimita chitaru, buleeyi bwe khucha angaaki chimita chitaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio aacha mu silibwa sisialola ebukwe, aaniina khu situumi siasio aapiima ebwingililo bwe silibwa; khukhwama khu ngaaki khucha asi siaba chimita chitaru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne chisiro che a lubeka chaba chimita chitaru bukhiikha, ne eye akari we chisiro yaba bubalaayi bwe chimita chibili ne nusu, ne khasiro khe silibwa ebweeni we ngila e lusiro we khufwaruriramo lulwaloleelela Lukaangu chimita chitaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio aapiima lusiro lwe khukhwefulilamo mukari e silibwa lwaba chimita chine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio aapiima lisiisi liliaba emita ndala buboofu. Lusiro lwe khukhwefuulilamo lwaba mukari siimbi lukali ne Lukaangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne chisiro chabaao chitaru chimbeka chombi che ngila e silibwa sie bukwe. Chisiro chino chaba chaleekhaana busa ne buboofu bwe lisiisi; buli lubeka liaba lialeekhaana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono omundu oyo aapiima bubalaayi bwe ngila eye silibwa, yaba chimita sita ne nusu ne bubalaayi bwe silibwa bwaba chimita chiraano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebweeni we chisiro che buliindi, lisiisi liliimbi liabaao chisendimita kamakhumi karaano khucha angaaki ne chisendimita kamakhumi karaano buboofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio aapiima buleeyi khukhwama khwisiisi lie nyuma lie lusiro khukhwola khwisiisi lie nyuma ne okhalisia engila, liaba chimita ekhumi na chibili ne nusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lusiro lwe aleeyi lwaba ne ngila eecha khu luuya lwe enje. Aapiima buleeyi bwe lusiro olwo, lwaba chimita ekhumi bubalaayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buleeyi bwoosi bwe ngila yoosi khukhwama khwisiisi lie enje lie silibwa, khukhwola lubeka lwe khu ndulo khwe lusiro lumaliilisi lwaba chimita kamakhumi kabili na chiraano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinuma chabaao khumasiisi ke nje koosi ke chisiro, akhaba kamasiisi ke mukari akari we chisiro. Khwaba ne kamakheendu niko bara khu masiisi ke mukari kakaloleelela silibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luuya lwenje",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio aambila mu luuya lwe enje, chisiro ne luuya lwe kamabaale, bioosi biabotookhela luuya. Chisiro kamakhumi kataru ebweeni we luuya lwe kamabaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luuya lwe kamabaale lwabira asilibwa, lwaba lulekhaana ne silibwa buleeyi, luno lwaba luuya lwe mwalo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabao engila eye angaaki eyachichanga mu luuya lwe mukari, omundu oyo aapiima buleeyi akari we bilibwa bibili, aanyoola chimita kamakhumi karaano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Silibwa sie bunaswa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omundu oyo aapiima buleeyi ne bubalaayi bwe silibwa sie bunaswa sisiachichanga khu luuya lwe nje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisiro chitaru che buliindi chaba buli lubeka lwe ngila akari we kamasiisi ne chisiro, ne lusiro lwe amuliango; bioosi biaba ne buleeyi ne bubalaayi bubwakana nende biili mu silibwa sie bukwe. Buleeyi bwoosi bwe silibwa bwaba chimita kamakhumi kabili na chiraano ne bukhiikha chimita likhumi na chibili ne nusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lusiro lwe khunyoa, kamatirisia, ne kamakheendu kakefuumba biaba nga ebio bibiaba mu silibwa sie bukwe. Ano biaba bikele saba bie khuniina khukhwama khu silibwa, ne lusiro lwe muliango lwaba khu ndulo, lwaloleelela khu luya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga ne obira luuya khukhwama khu silibwa sie ebunaswa, bulayi bwene nga sie ebukwe, silibwa sisiindi siabaao siicha khu luuya lwe mukari. Omundu oyo aapiima buleeyi akari we bilibwa bibili bino mala aanyoola ali bili chimita kamakhumi karaano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Silibwa sie siafubo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
