          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omundu oyo aandeera khu luya lwe mukari khubirira mu silibwa sie siafubo, mala aapiima silibwa sie siafubo, siaba silekhaana ne bilibwa bibiindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisiro che lubeka, chisiro che buliindi nende chichiingila mukari chaba chilekhaana busa ne chichiindi, kamatirisia kabaakho buli lubeka ne khu chisiro che buliindi, buleeyi bwalwo bwaba chimita kamakhumi kabili na chiraano ne bubalaayi ekhumi na chibili ne sisiinja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khwabao ne chisiro che mukari buli lubeka, buleeyi chimita ekhumi na chibili ne sisiinja ne bukhiikha chimita chibili ne sisiinja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lusiro olwo lwaloleelela luuya lwe enje, ne kamakheendu kaba khu siro che buliindi buli lubeka, ne engila yasio yaba bikele munaane bie khuniinilakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.31"
            ]
          }
        }
