            "sid": "EZK 40:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu luya lwe nje yabao enju eyetiila khu silibwa sie mukari sisialoleelela ebunaswa. Enju yino yaba yaloleelela mu lusiro lwe mukari lulwaloleelela khu luya lwe nje niio basiingilanga chinyama che chisaang'i che chimbosio che khukhwosia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu lusiro lwe muliango luno, chimesa chine chabaamo, chibili buli lubeka lwe lusiro. Khwaba khu mesa chino nikhwo beereranga chisaang'i che chimbosio che khukhwosia ne chimbosio che khurusiao bubwoni nende che kumuruungo kwe khurusiao bumayaanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enje we lusiro, chabao chimesa chine chifwaanane, chibili buli lubeka lwe silibwa sie bunaswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Choosi chaba chimesa munaane nicho beererangakho chimbosio chine mu lusiro mukari ne chine enje khu luya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimesa chine che kamabaale kamabeeche chino, mu nju ekiindi endasakho; charumikhwanga khurekekha chimbosio che khukhwosia. Chaba chisendimita kamakhumi karaano khucha angaaki, ne lulama lwacho lwaba chisendimita kamakhumi saba na chiraano buli lubeka. Buli siindu sisiarumikhanga mu khwira chisaang'i che chimbosio chino siabiikhwangwa khu mesa chino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne chingaki buleeyi bwe kumukhono mulala chaba khu ndulo khwe chimesa echo mukari. Chinyama choosi che chimbosio charechwangwa khu mesa khu ngaaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
