          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu oyo aamboolela ali, “Lusiro lulwaloleelela siafubo luli lwe basaayi babemeelelanga mu Lukaangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne lusiro lulwaloleelela ebunaswa, luli lwe basaayi babemeelelanga khu alutare. Basaayi boosi bamanga khu lisaaye lia Satoki. Nibo bong'ene be lisaaye lia Lawi, bafukiililwa khucha ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luuya lwe mukari ne Lukaangu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu oyo, aapiima bubalaayi bwe luuya lwe mukari; lwaba chimita kamakhumi karaano buli lubeka. Alutare yaba ebweeni we Lukaangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio aambila mu lusiro lwe muliango kwe Lukaangu mala aapiima chisiro che buliindi nende che mukari. Chaba chimita chibili ne nusu chimbeka chichaloleelelana, ne bubalaayi bwe silibwa chimita saba, ne lisiisi lie khu silibwa emita ndala ne nusu chimbeka chombi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Engila yabaao eye khuniinilakho khu lusiro lwe khucha mukari. Lusiro olwo lwaba bubalaayi chimita ekhumi ne chimita sita khucha asi. Chinjeko chibili chaba khu ndulo khwe chisiro che buliindi, buli lubeka enjeko ndala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
